Study Plan</span></p><p style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><span style="color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">[Form4]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">: Recommendation Form</span></p><p style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><span style="color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">[Form4_1]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Reference Letter Form for the Counseling Psychology applicants</span></p><p style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><span style="color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">[Form5]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">:&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">Release of Information Form</span></p></div><p style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><span style="color: rgb(204, 61, 61);"><br></span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;">※ Online Application Page (Only effective during the application period)</span></p><p style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><a href="https://enter.jinhakapply.com/Notice/1216033/A" target="_blank" class="tx-link"><img class="txc-image" src="https://scc.sogang.ac.kr/dataview/cmsdir/20170810_1121_5010001.gif" style="max-width: 100%;"></a></p><div class="txt0" style="font-size: 13.3333px;"><p></p><p class="txt0"><span style="color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;"><i>Please check the scholarship section of the above admission guidebook, as the tuition and scholarship information was updated on May 15.</i></span></p><p class="txt0"><br></p><p class="0" 맑은="" 고딕";="" line-h